OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies following fire in flat
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man in his 60s has died following a
OL,6,Ffire at a flat in Londonderry.
OL,8,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,9,FService (NIFRS) was called to the blaze
OL,10,Fin Bloomfield Park in at 15.39 BST on
OL,11,FWednesday.
OL,13,FFive fire appliances were sent to the
OL,14,Fscene, and firefighters wearing
OL,15,Fbreathing apparatus used three hose
OL,16,Freel jets and one jet to extinguish the
OL,17,Ffire.
OL,19,FThe NIFRS said the incident was dealt
OL,20,Fwith by 18:16 BST and the cause of the
OL,21,Ffire remains under investigation.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
